# RecoverAI environment variables
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the values you need:
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# `.env.local` is gitignored. Never commit a real API key.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Google Gemini API key — OPTIONAL
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Most users should leave this blank and enter their key in the app instead
# (⚙️ Settings → Gemini API Key), which stores it in browser localStorage only.
#
# Set this ONLY for demo or preview deployments where you want AI features to
# work without each visitor supplying a key.
#
# ⚠️ SECURITY: Vite inlines every VITE_* variable into the client bundle at
# build time. A key set here is PUBLIC and readable by anyone who visits the
# site. If you use it:
#   - create a dedicated key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#   - apply HTTP referrer restrictions and a low quota cap
#   - rotate it regularly and never reuse a production key
#
# A key entered in the app's Settings always overrides this value.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=
